									<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Title:&nbsp;
										<span id="dl_news__ctl0_Label4"><font face="Verdana" size="1">New links added for Quests</font></span></P>
									<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Date:
										<span id="dl_news__ctl0_Label2"><font face="Verdana" size="1">5/19/2004 3:13:26 PM</font></span></P>
									<P>
										<span id="dl_news__ctl0_Label1"><font face="Verdana" size="1">Two new links have been add. <A href="http://spinpcycle.serverpro2.com/progression.htm">Planar Progression</A> and <A href="http://spinpcycle.serverpro2.com/vp.htm">Veeshan's Peak</A> guide have both been added to the Links to everything section. Keep up the good work.</font></span></P>
								</td>
		</tr><tr>
			<td>
									<P>
